WEBVTT

00:00:01.020 --> 00:00:01.760
Huh?

00:00:01.760 --> 00:00:03.060
We're missing one-dechu!

00:00:03.060 --> 00:00:04.480
Eh?!

00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:05.650
This is bad!

00:00:05.650 --> 00:00:06.940
Gaaruru's not on board!

00:00:06.940 --> 00:00:09.190
Eh?!  Gaalulu's not?!

00:00:09.650 --> 00:00:10.600
What should we do?

00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:11.860
The helicopter's about to leave!

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:15.730
We need to find her-dechu!

00:00:15.730 --> 00:00:17.300
You go ahead, Unicorn.

00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:21.030
Falulu will stay here and find Gaalulu.

00:00:21.030 --> 00:00:22.310
But!

00:00:22.310 --> 00:00:26.280
Our flight bound for PriPari is now departing.

00:00:26.280 --> 00:00:27.840
Got it-dechu.

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:32.470
Falulu, girls, I'm counting on you-dechu!

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:38.130
Where could Gaalulu be?

00:00:38.130 --> 00:00:41.180
First off, why would Gaalulu have run off?

00:00:42.410 --> 00:00:46.440
Gaalulu probably didn't want to go back.

00:00:46.440 --> 00:00:48.400
She won't have fun even if she does.

00:00:48.830 --> 00:00:50.190
That's true.

00:00:50.190 --> 00:00:57.200
Unicorn mentioned that all of the dejected feelings of girls who failed to be idols are gathered inside her...

00:00:57.640 --> 00:00:58.780
Yeah.

00:00:58.780 --> 00:01:04.380
That's why Gaalulu's different than the others and hates music and dancing.

00:01:04.380 --> 00:01:05.920
That's right.

00:01:08.170 --> 00:01:10.590
What should Falulu do?

00:01:10.590 --> 00:01:11.850
Let's look for her!

00:01:11.850 --> 00:01:12.420
Yeah.

00:01:12.420 --> 00:01:13.630
Found her-kuma!

00:01:13.630 --> 00:01:14.340
Eh?

00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:16.020
She's over there-kuma.

00:01:16.020 --> 00:01:17.140
Let me see!

00:01:18.300 --> 00:01:19.050
Kuma.

00:01:21.010 --> 00:01:23.250
He's right! It's Gaalulu!

00:02:54.990 --> 00:02:56.190
It's Sunny Once In A While.

00:02:56.190 --> 00:02:57.430
Gaalulu!

00:03:02.000 --> 00:03:03.920
I thought she was around here.

00:03:03.920 --> 00:03:05.830
There she is!

00:03:09.270 --> 00:03:10.500
Stop!

00:03:10.500 --> 00:03:13.300
Gaalulu, everyone already left.

00:03:13.300 --> 00:03:14.850
You need to head back, too!

00:03:14.850 --> 00:03:15.500
Gaalulu!

00:03:15.500 --> 00:03:17.460
Ouchies!

00:03:17.460 --> 00:03:20.800
This calls for the fast-footed Usagi-usa!

00:03:21.300 --> 00:03:21.830
Gaalulu!

00:03:21.830 --> 00:03:23.140
Usa!
Gaalulu!

00:03:23.140 --> 00:03:26.610
Kuma!

00:03:27.100 --> 00:03:28.850
Kuma's out.

00:03:28.850 --> 00:03:30.600
Gaalulu!

00:03:31.680 --> 00:03:33.910
Are you all okay?

00:03:33.910 --> 00:03:35.590
Falulu's sorry.

00:03:35.590 --> 00:03:38.320
Falulu is supposed to be Gaalulu's guardian.

00:03:38.770 --> 00:03:40.350
Is this Falulu's fault?

00:03:40.810 --> 00:03:41.630
I see.

00:03:42.140 --> 00:03:44.550
Falulu's hopeless.

00:03:45.450 --> 00:03:47.500
It's not your fault, Falulu!

00:03:47.500 --> 00:03:53.730
You're doing the best you can in raising so many Mini Falulus-pri!

00:03:54.320 --> 00:03:57.800
But whenever Falulu calls Gaalulu to come back,

00:03:58.210 --> 00:04:00.760
she never comes back.

00:04:00.760 --> 00:04:02.530
And she's always by herself.

00:04:02.530 --> 00:04:05.720
On top of that, if you try to make friends with her or greet her,

00:04:05.720 --> 00:04:08.160
she'll bite you.

00:04:08.680 --> 00:04:11.490
She hates both singing and dance lessons,

00:04:11.490 --> 00:04:14.490
and she won't watch any of Falulu's concerts.

00:04:14.490 --> 00:04:17.160
And for some reason when Falulu tries to talk to her,

00:04:17.160 --> 00:04:20.020
all she ever says is Gaalulu!

00:04:21.590 --> 00:04:25.640
And to top it off, Falulu does her best
to raise all the Mini Falulus,

00:04:25.640 --> 00:04:28.190
but she still has a long way to go with Gaalulu.

00:04:28.820 --> 00:04:31.080
What should Falulu do?

00:04:31.080 --> 00:04:32.770
No! Don't!

00:04:32.770 --> 00:04:35.830
You're just completely exhausted from raising all those Mini Falulus-pri!

00:04:36.330 --> 00:04:40.350
Anyway, you just sit back and take a breather, Falulu.

00:04:40.350 --> 00:04:43.260
We'll make sure to find Gaalulu!

00:04:43.610 --> 00:04:45.510
Leave it to us-pri!
Leave it to us.

00:04:50.650 --> 00:04:53.730
I've heard all thee has spoken.

00:04:54.460 --> 00:04:58.110
After all, all children are demon spawn.

00:04:58.110 --> 00:05:00.830
Whether to neglect that demon or not,

00:05:00.830 --> 00:05:02.440
it is up to thee!

00:05:02.900 --> 00:05:06.060
Which means all of it is thy responsibility.

00:05:06.060 --> 00:05:07.850
Well?

00:05:07.850 --> 00:05:09.910
How will thee take responsibility?

00:05:10.710 --> 00:05:14.790
Aloma's trying to say if you have troubles, why not consult someone-nano.

00:05:14.790 --> 00:05:15.600
Look.

00:05:17.400 --> 00:05:19.660
Childcare consultation?

00:05:22.020 --> 00:05:23.340
Gaalulu!

00:05:24.060 --> 00:05:25.940
We've finally got you cornered!

00:05:25.940 --> 00:05:27.870
Relax, Gaalulu.

00:05:27.870 --> 00:05:30.300
Unfortunately for you, this is the end of the road, Gaalulu.

00:05:30.730 --> 00:05:33.880
We just want to talk a little bit, Gaalulu.

00:05:33.880 --> 00:05:35.650
If there's anything troubling you,

00:05:35.650 --> 00:05:38.560
we'd like you to tell us without biting us.

00:05:38.560 --> 00:05:40.020
Gaalulu!

00:05:40.020 --> 00:05:42.900
Gaalu Gaalu Gaalulu!

00:05:42.900 --> 00:05:44.230
Gaalulu?

00:05:44.230 --> 00:05:45.490
Gaalu Gaalu.

00:05:45.490 --> 00:05:47.780
Gaalulu gaalu gaalu gaalulu!

00:05:48.240 --> 00:05:50.050
She's like a wild dog.

00:05:50.050 --> 00:05:51.990
If it's a dog, you can leave it to me-pri.

00:05:53.040 --> 00:05:54.780
I used to raise a dog.

00:05:54.780 --> 00:05:56.950
When they had a bad temper,

00:05:56.950 --> 00:06:00.030
I'd give them a bone and they'd wag their tail and be happy-pri.

00:06:00.030 --> 00:06:00.500
Gaalu!
I'd give them a bone and they'd wag their tail and be happy-pri.

00:06:00.500 --> 00:06:01.560
Pri!

00:06:01.560 --> 00:06:03.210
My idol tush!

00:06:03.750 --> 00:06:08.290
When I'm upset, I eat sea snails.

00:06:08.290 --> 00:06:11.590
The sensation of biting into it when it's crispy is to die for!

00:06:11.590 --> 00:06:13.940
So here's some sea snail.

00:06:13.940 --> 00:06:14.930
Gaalulu!

00:06:14.930 --> 00:06:17.670
Ah! Sea snail-san!

00:06:18.660 --> 00:06:20.060
Toriko understands-tori.

00:06:20.060 --> 00:06:22.030
You're going to go after Toriko next-tori.

00:06:22.030 --> 00:06:23.590
But Toriko is a terrible substitute-tori.

00:06:23.590 --> 00:06:25.510
Even if it's a wing or done teriyaki style,

00:06:25.510 --> 00:06:28.990
you'll just complain that it's not as good as the Nagoya Cochin-tori.

00:06:28.990 --> 00:06:31.340
So there's really no reward to eating Toriko.

00:06:31.340 --> 00:06:33.490
But this is Toriko's destiny-tori!

00:06:36.010 --> 00:06:37.280
You like it?

00:06:37.280 --> 00:06:40.990
We can't eat Nagoya Cochin when we're in the Palps.

00:06:41.640 --> 00:06:43.920
It's carnivorous-tori?!

00:06:47.350 --> 00:06:48.500
I got it!

00:06:48.500 --> 00:06:54.270
To tell you the truth, I was worried about my loud voice before I came to PriPara.

00:06:54.270 --> 00:06:56.760
But ever since I sang my first song,

00:06:56.760 --> 00:06:59.220
I've come to love my voice.

00:06:59.220 --> 00:07:00.750
So the two of us-

00:07:00.750 --> 00:07:01.980
Gaalulu!

00:07:04.390 --> 00:07:06.990
Gaalulu! Galulu ga!

00:07:06.990 --> 00:07:08.660
What did she say?

00:07:09.260 --> 00:07:14.560
She said that she hates singing and dancing.

00:07:14.560 --> 00:07:17.660
Sophie, you can understand what Gaalulu's saying?

00:07:17.660 --> 00:07:18.360
Yeah.

00:07:19.730 --> 00:07:21.210
Gaalulu,

00:07:21.800 --> 00:07:23.720
there's nothing to worry about.

00:07:23.720 --> 00:07:26.420
After all, ever since I was born,

00:07:26.420 --> 00:07:29.420
my cries have sounded like singing.

00:07:31.380 --> 00:07:34.880
On top of that, ever since I took my first wobbly steps,

00:07:34.880 --> 00:07:36.680
I've been able to dance well.

00:07:38.930 --> 00:07:40.690
So as long as you set your mind to-

00:07:40.690 --> 00:07:43.640
Gaalulu!

00:07:43.640 --> 00:07:45.650
Gaalulu, wait!

00:07:45.650 --> 00:07:46.720
Ouch.

00:07:46.720 --> 00:07:47.720
Sophie...

00:07:47.720 --> 00:07:50.030
There's no way that was going to work-pri!

00:07:50.030 --> 00:07:52.530
There aren't many people who can do what you can-pri.

00:07:52.530 --> 00:07:54.990
Eh? There aren't?

00:07:54.990 --> 00:07:56.170
Of course not!

00:07:56.170 --> 00:07:59.040
That's why those who can are called geniuses-pri!

00:07:59.040 --> 00:08:00.730
Gaalulu!

00:08:04.260 --> 00:08:05.390
It hurts.

00:08:09.000 --> 00:08:10.520
Did you lose her-pri?

00:08:10.520 --> 00:08:12.430
All right, let's split up and look for her.

00:08:15.360 --> 00:08:16.740
Mega-neesan!

00:08:17.330 --> 00:08:20.690
Has a little girl been through here?

00:08:20.690 --> 00:08:22.600
She went that way.

00:08:24.800 --> 00:08:26.810
It looks like she went up-pri.

00:08:42.460 --> 00:08:43.870
Gaalulu.

00:08:58.000 --> 00:09:00.840
It's once again time to do the periodic system inspection.

00:09:00.840 --> 00:09:04.770
We will be changing the weather inside PriPara at random.

00:09:04.770 --> 00:09:11.790
All idols currently playing in PriPara, please stay calm and don't panic when the weather changes.

00:09:11.790 --> 00:09:13.480
Is this a drill?

00:09:20.050 --> 00:09:21.710
Check complete.

00:09:21.710 --> 00:09:22.620
Next.

00:09:43.180 --> 00:09:46.680
No problems found. That's all for today.

00:09:46.680 --> 00:09:49.150
Let's check the rest of them tomorrow.

00:09:54.640 --> 00:09:55.700
Gaalulu.

00:09:56.780 --> 00:09:58.070
Gaalu...

00:10:02.740 --> 00:10:04.720
Gaalulu?

00:10:07.160 --> 00:10:08.920
So what will you do?

00:10:08.920 --> 00:10:10.480
How will you take responsibility?

00:10:10.480 --> 00:10:11.480
Huh? Huh?!

00:10:11.480 --> 00:10:13.240
W-Well...

00:10:13.240 --> 00:10:14.840
Don't worry-nano!

00:10:14.840 --> 00:10:18.130
Starting now Aloma will give you encouragement.

00:10:18.130 --> 00:10:22.020
Aloma Prophecy Grimoire, chapter 9, section 29:

00:10:22.020 --> 00:10:26.620
"The little demon's essence shall become a giant monster and the final war of the demons shall-

00:10:29.160 --> 00:10:31.060
What's that sound?!

00:10:31.060 --> 00:10:34.280
Gaadzilla!

00:10:34.280 --> 00:10:35.500
Wow!

00:10:35.500 --> 00:10:37.210
It's a monster-nano!

00:10:38.070 --> 00:10:39.700
Gaalu.

00:10:41.660 --> 00:10:45.620
Gaadzilla!

00:10:45.620 --> 00:10:49.720
Gaalulu! Gaalulu!

00:10:49.720 --> 00:10:51.080
Where are you-pri?

00:10:51.080 --> 00:10:53.090
Gaalulu...

00:10:53.620 --> 00:10:54.450
Eh?!

00:10:54.450 --> 00:10:55.700
What's that?!

00:10:56.490 --> 00:10:58.300
That's the monster Gaadzilla.

00:10:58.300 --> 00:11:00.170
The monster Gaadzilla?!

00:11:02.120 --> 00:11:03.340
Oh no.

00:11:03.340 --> 00:11:05.220
I'll see what's going on.

00:11:05.220 --> 00:11:08.070
Please make your way outside, girls.

00:11:08.070 --> 00:11:09.530
But Gaalulu is...

00:11:09.530 --> 00:11:12.060
I'll fix this soon so please head to the evacuation area.

00:11:14.020 --> 00:11:32.110
Gaadzilla!

00:11:32.110 --> 00:11:32.580
Kuma?!

00:11:37.820 --> 00:11:39.350
The TV station...

00:11:39.350 --> 00:11:41.590
Where'd this monster suddenly come from?

00:11:42.170 --> 00:11:46.510
Monster Gaadzilla came out of PriPara's hologramation-pri.

00:11:46.510 --> 00:11:47.810
Gaadzilla!

00:11:47.810 --> 00:11:52.870
It's possible that someone is
intentionally manipulating the system.

00:11:52.870 --> 00:11:54.690
Hey you! Stupid Gaadzilla!

00:11:55.020 --> 00:11:56.830
Why do you think you're doing?!

00:11:56.830 --> 00:11:57.920
Ga?

00:11:57.920 --> 00:11:59.020
He looked at us!

00:11:59.020 --> 00:12:01.530
Gaadzilla!

00:12:05.620 --> 00:12:07.340
Gaalulu...

00:12:07.340 --> 00:12:09.410
Where's everyone else?

00:12:11.620 --> 00:12:13.430
Gaalu...

00:12:21.430 --> 00:12:22.680
Oh my.

00:12:25.510 --> 00:12:27.110
Eh...?

00:12:29.680 --> 00:12:30.850
Don't want to open, huh?

00:12:35.770 --> 00:12:36.270
At long last the final war has descended upon us!

00:12:36.270 --> 00:12:38.360
Monster-san!

00:12:38.360 --> 00:12:40.730
Don't do that!

00:12:41.550 --> 00:12:46.660
You can do it! You can do it! You can do it!

00:12:49.100 --> 00:12:50.120
Gaalu...?

00:12:52.130 --> 00:12:53.620
Oh, Gaalulu!

00:12:53.620 --> 00:12:54.520
Gaalu!

00:12:54.520 --> 00:12:55.330
Wait!

00:12:56.330 --> 00:12:59.500
Gaadzilla!

00:12:59.840 --> 00:13:01.710
PriPara TV's antenna!

00:13:02.590 --> 00:13:05.120
Gaalulu is still inside the TV station!

00:13:05.120 --> 00:13:06.050
Yeah.

00:13:08.050 --> 00:13:11.660
Everyone, we're setting down.

00:13:11.660 --> 00:13:13.070
Please get in!

00:13:13.070 --> 00:13:15.270
We'll search from the sky-chanko.

00:13:18.170 --> 00:13:21.190
Gaalulu, wait!

00:13:21.190 --> 00:13:23.330
Let's head back.

00:13:24.150 --> 00:13:26.570
Gaadzilla!

00:13:26.570 --> 00:13:28.280
Gaalu...

00:13:29.320 --> 00:13:30.490
It's dangerous!

00:13:30.490 --> 00:13:32.620
Gaadzilla!

00:13:36.910 --> 00:13:37.930
Gaalu?

00:13:40.600 --> 00:13:42.890
Pushuu~.

00:13:45.520 --> 00:13:48.000
I can't move any more.

00:13:48.000 --> 00:13:49.680
Save yourself, Gaalulu.

00:13:50.890 --> 00:13:54.810
Gaadzilla!

00:13:57.090 --> 00:13:58.800
Gaalu...

00:13:58.800 --> 00:14:00.190
I'm sorry...

00:14:00.190 --> 00:14:00.980
Gaalu?

00:14:01.680 --> 00:14:04.440
...about what I said earlier.

00:14:09.550 --> 00:14:12.220
Don't. Save yourself.

00:14:12.220 --> 00:14:14.570
This is always happening to me.

00:14:14.570 --> 00:14:15.940
Gaalulu.

00:14:15.940 --> 00:14:17.490
You see,

00:14:17.490 --> 00:14:20.110
I'm not all that different than you.

00:14:20.110 --> 00:14:21.130
Gaalu?

00:14:21.610 --> 00:14:25.480
But thanks to some magic,

00:14:25.480 --> 00:14:28.590
I was also able to stand on stage.

00:14:29.300 --> 00:14:32.810
To me it's a magical item.

00:14:33.550 --> 00:14:37.580
And since I'm like this, I'm always eating it.

00:14:38.680 --> 00:14:41.700
I'd like you to try it too, Gaalulu.

00:14:42.370 --> 00:14:43.020
Gaalu?

00:14:43.710 --> 00:14:45.450
Sophie-sama,

00:14:45.640 --> 00:14:48.360
incoming Red Flash!

00:14:48.650 --> 00:14:50.350
Cha... Chan...

00:14:50.350 --> 00:14:52.590
Chankokokokoko....

00:14:55.040 --> 00:15:00.960
Chanko!

00:15:03.210 --> 00:15:04.090
Ga?!

00:15:08.470 --> 00:15:10.520
Ga-ga-ga-ga-

00:15:10.520 --> 00:15:14.660
Gaalulu!

00:15:21.200 --> 00:15:23.230
Sophie! Gaalulu!

00:15:23.230 --> 00:15:23.690
Pri!

00:15:23.690 --> 00:15:24.310
Kuma!

00:15:24.780 --> 00:15:26.510
Sophie, you're injured!

00:15:26.510 --> 00:15:27.960
Are you okay?

00:15:36.380 --> 00:15:37.580
She coughed something up-pri.

00:15:39.110 --> 00:15:40.260
Oh!

00:15:41.140 --> 00:15:42.670
What is it-pri?

00:15:43.410 --> 00:15:45.150
A burr bug.

00:15:45.150 --> 00:15:48.960
Since it's a valuable specimen, we'll keep it in the PriPara Museum.

00:15:51.910 --> 00:15:53.260
We did it!

00:15:57.030 --> 00:15:59.200
We should be good now!

00:15:59.200 --> 00:16:00.680
We're good now!

00:16:02.850 --> 00:16:09.860
Gaadzilla...

00:16:10.460 --> 00:16:13.630
You caused a lot of trouble for everyone.

00:16:13.630 --> 00:16:16.090
PriPara is something everyone desires.

00:16:16.090 --> 00:16:17.580
It's their dream.

00:16:18.090 --> 00:16:20.830
And you almost destroyed it, Gaalulu!

00:16:22.850 --> 00:16:24.360
However...

00:16:25.970 --> 00:16:32.010
Falulu was still really, really worried about you.

00:16:33.670 --> 00:16:36.880
Gaalulu can't sing or dance.

00:16:37.400 --> 00:16:40.470
She's sad and lonely.

00:16:41.990 --> 00:16:43.090
Gaalulu...

00:16:43.090 --> 00:16:44.400
...spoke!

00:16:44.400 --> 00:16:46.900
And it wasn't "gaalu gaalu" either!

00:16:50.290 --> 00:16:51.440
Gaalulu!

00:16:53.590 --> 00:16:57.280
We want you to watch our concert, Gaalulu.

00:17:03.500 --> 00:17:06.220
Please scan the appropriate number of My Tickets for your coord.

00:17:07.130 --> 00:17:09.960
You can also scan each other's Friend Tickets.

00:17:09.960 --> 00:17:11.910
Coord Change Start!

00:17:14.760 --> 00:17:18.930
When you go out on a sunny day, take a light pastel coloured parasol with you.

00:17:18.930 --> 00:17:21.520
Sunny Parasol Coord!

00:17:25.070 --> 00:17:30.500
Even if it's raining, if you bring a poppin' polka dot umbrella, it'll liven up the mood.

00:17:30.500 --> 00:17:32.530
Rainy Parasol Coord!

00:17:32.830 --> 00:17:33.810
Pri!

00:17:35.290 --> 00:17:36.530
Even if it's cloudy,

00:17:36.530 --> 00:17:38.590
or there's a splash of monster Gaadzilla in the weather,

00:17:38.590 --> 00:17:41.980
let's perform in impressive Parasol Coords!

00:17:41.980 --> 00:17:43.750
Cloudy Parasol Coord!

00:18:17.360 --> 00:18:18.970
<i>Watch us, Gaalulu.</i>

00:18:18.970 --> 00:18:21.720
<i>Singing and dancing can be so much fun!</i>

00:18:21.720 --> 00:18:23.800
<i>Concerts are awesome-pri!</i>

00:18:23.800 --> 00:18:27.330
<i>I want to share this fun with you, Gaalulu!</i>

00:18:44.180 --> 00:18:47.520
Making Drama Switch On!

00:18:48.020 --> 00:18:48.780
Princess...

00:18:48.780 --> 00:18:50.770
Princess, where are you-kuma?!

00:18:52.940 --> 00:18:53.930
Kuma?

00:18:54.780 --> 00:18:56.560
Flower garden in full bloom!

00:18:56.560 --> 00:18:57.780
For you!

00:18:58.060 --> 00:19:01.760
Lovely Flower Cinderella!

00:19:01.760 --> 00:19:03.030
Kuma!

00:19:04.720 --> 00:19:07.630
Cyalume Change!

00:19:54.000 --> 00:19:55.840
SoLaMi is the best!

00:19:58.330 --> 00:20:00.050
Gaalulu's smiling!

00:20:00.860 --> 00:20:02.620
Sophie!

00:20:05.060 --> 00:20:06.750
Awesome! Awesome!

00:20:06.750 --> 00:20:09.390
Concerts are awesome! Concerts are fun!

00:20:09.830 --> 00:20:10.980
Gaalulu...

00:20:13.470 --> 00:20:15.390
Sorry.

00:20:16.680 --> 00:20:20.110
Gaalulu caused a lot of problems.

00:20:21.190 --> 00:20:22.700
Gaalulu!

00:20:23.490 --> 00:20:24.750
It's okay.

00:20:24.750 --> 00:20:27.770
Falulu loves Gaalulu!

00:20:28.460 --> 00:20:29.660
Falulu...

00:20:30.190 --> 00:20:31.800
Isn't that great.

00:20:31.800 --> 00:20:32.710
Yeah.

00:20:35.460 --> 00:20:38.390
Let's all perform together next time!

00:20:38.390 --> 00:20:40.090
Yeah, it's a promise.

00:20:40.090 --> 00:20:44.050
Lala, it's a little late, but here's your one year anniversary present.

00:20:44.050 --> 00:20:45.340
Let me see your charm.

00:20:45.340 --> 00:20:46.020
Huh?

00:20:47.790 --> 00:20:48.800
It's wonderful!

00:20:48.800 --> 00:20:49.560
Thanks!

00:20:49.950 --> 00:20:51.720
Gaalulu will also perform.

00:20:51.720 --> 00:20:53.210
Eh?!

00:20:53.210 --> 00:20:55.890
She'll be the best and end up in the parade.

00:20:56.960 --> 00:20:58.430
Isn't that cute!

00:20:58.430 --> 00:21:00.010
That'd be nice.

00:21:00.010 --> 00:21:02.780
Well, it takes effort to accomplish anything.

00:21:03.490 --> 00:21:05.750
Ouch!

00:21:05.750 --> 00:21:07.850
Wait, it doesn't hurt.

00:21:07.850 --> 00:21:09.600
She's just play biting.

00:21:09.600 --> 00:21:11.950
Gaalulu, any type of biting is bad.

00:21:12.330 --> 00:21:14.830
But Gaalulu is the Monster Idol!

00:21:15.250 --> 00:21:17.000
Monster Idol?

00:21:17.540 --> 00:21:18.370
Yeah.

00:21:20.630 --> 00:21:22.140
Bye bye!

00:21:24.510 --> 00:21:27.890
<i>Until we meet again, Monster Idol-chan.</i>

00:21:27.890 --> 00:21:30.210
Bye bye!

00:21:30.210 --> 00:21:31.850
Take care!

00:23:05.880 --> 00:23:08.950
Ah, whenever I think about it I get angry!

00:23:08.950 --> 00:23:10.160
Relax, Dorothy.

00:23:10.160 --> 00:23:11.360
What's wrong?

00:23:11.360 --> 00:23:13.070
That Mysterious Thief Genius.

00:23:13.070 --> 00:23:16.290
I won't forgive him for stealing our coords!

00:23:16.290 --> 00:23:17.430
That's true.

00:23:18.080 --> 00:23:19.500
I figured it out!

00:23:19.500 --> 00:23:21.330
Genius's true identity!

00:23:21.330 --> 00:23:22.540
Really?!

00:23:22.540 --> 00:23:24.960
I'll catch him no matter what!

00:23:24.960 --> 00:23:26.340
If you say so, Dorothy!

00:23:26.340 --> 00:23:27.760
Lovely!

00:23:28.260 --> 00:23:29.180
Next time:

00:23:29.180 --> 00:23:30.000
It's summer!

00:23:30.000 --> 00:23:31.790
Max Pool Love!

00:23:31.790 --> 00:23:33.160
Aim for your dreams!

00:23:33.160 --> 00:23:34.720
Let's go PriPara!
